```ejs
<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Password Reset - TaskFlow</title>
</head>

<body style="
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  background-color: #f8fafc;
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
">

  <table
    width="100%"
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    border="0"
    style="
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    "
  >
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <!-- Main Container -->
        <table
          width="100%"
          cellpadding="0"
          cellspacing="0"
          border="0"
          style="
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 14px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
          "
        >

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td
              style="
                background-color: #4f46e5;
                padding: 32px 30px;
                text-align: center;
              "
            >

              <!-- Logo -->
              <div
                style="
                  width: 58px;
                  height: 58px;
                  margin: 0 auto 14px;
                  background-color: #ffffff;
                  border-radius: 14px;
                  line-height: 58px;
                  font-size: 28px;
                  font-weight: bold;
                  color: #4f46e5;
                "
              >
                ✓
              </div>

              <h1
                style="
                  margin: 0;
                  color: #ffffff;
                  font-size: 25px;
                  font-weight: 700;
                "
              >
                Password Reset
              </h1>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 8px 0 0;
                  color: #e0e7ff;
                  font-size: 14px;
                "
              >
                Secure your TaskFlow account
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 35px 30px;">

              <h2
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 15px;
                  color: #0f172a;
                  font-size: 22px;
                "
              >
                Hello <%= name %>,
              </h2>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 20px;
                  color: #475569;
                  font-size: 15px;
                  line-height: 1.7;
                "
              >
                We received a request to reset your TaskFlow password.
                Use the One-Time Password (OTP) below to continue.
              </p>

              <!-- OTP -->
              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
              >
                <tr>
                  <td
                    align="center"
                    style="padding: 10px 0 25px;"
                  >

                    <div
                      style="
                        display: inline-block;
                        background-color: #eef2ff;
                        border: 2px dashed #4f46e5;
                        border-radius: 10px;
                        padding: 18px 35px;
                      "
                    >

                      <span
                        style="
                          font-size: 32px;
                          font-weight: bold;
                          letter-spacing: 8px;
                          color: #4f46e5;
                        "
                      >
                        <%= otp %>
                      </span>

                    </div>

                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Expiration -->
              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0 0 25px;
                  text-align: center;
                  color: #dc2626;
                  font-size: 14px;
                  font-weight: bold;
                "
              >
                This OTP will expire in <%= expiresIn %> minutes.
              </p>

              <!-- Security Notice -->
              <table
                width="100%"
                cellpadding="0"
                cellspacing="0"
                border="0"
              >
                <tr>
                  <td
                    style="
                      background-color: #f8fafc;
                      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
                      border-left: 4px solid #06b6d4;
                      border-radius: 8px;
                      padding: 18px;
                    "
                  >

                    <p
                      style="
                        margin: 0;
                        color: #475569;
                        font-size: 14px;
                        line-height: 1.6;
                      "
                    >

                      <strong style="color: #0f172a;">
                        Security Notice
                      </strong>

                      <br>

                      Never share this OTP with anyone.
                      The TaskFlow team will never ask you for your
                      OTP or password.

                    </p>

                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Additional Message -->
              <p
                style="
                  margin: 25px 0 0;
                  color: #64748b;
                  font-size: 14px;
                  line-height: 1.6;
                "
              >
                If you did not request a password reset, you can safely
                ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td
              style="
                background-color: #f8fafc;
                padding: 24px 30px;
                text-align: center;
                border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
              "
            >

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 0;
                  color: #4f46e5;
                  font-size: 16px;
                  font-weight: 700;
                "
              >
                TaskFlow
              </p>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 7px 0 0;
                  color: #64748b;
                  font-size: 12px;
                "
              >
                Plan • Collaborate • Track • Deliver
              </p>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 12px 0 0;
                  color: #94a3b8;
                  font-size: 12px;
                "
              >
                This is an automated email. Please do not reply.
              </p>

              <p
                style="
                  margin: 7px 0 0;
                  color: #94a3b8;
                  font-size: 12px;
                "
              >
                &copy; 2026 TaskFlow. All rights reserved.
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>

</html>
```
